    "statementHTML": "<div class=\"statement-body\">\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-goal\">\n   <h2><span class=\"icon icon-goal\">&nbsp;</span><span>Goal </span></h2>\n   <span class=\"question-statement\">Given a 2D grid of integers, compute the sum of the four orthogonal neighbours (up, down, left, right) of a given positions.<br>Positions outside the grid are ignored.</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-protocol\">\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-input\"><strong>Line 1:</strong> Two space-separated integers <var>H</var> and <var>W</var> representing the height and width of the grid.<br><strong>Next <var>H</var> lines:</strong> <var>W</var> space-separated integers representing the grid.<br><strong>Next line:</strong> Two space-separated integers <var>R</var> and <var>C</var> representing the row and column of the target position (0-based indices).</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-output\"><strong>Line 1:</strong> A single integer representing the sum of the orthogonal neighbouring positions.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Constraints</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-constraints\">1 &le; <var>H</var>, <var>W</var> &le; 10<br>-1000 &le; grid values &le; 1000<br>0 &le; <var>R</var> &lt; <var>H</var><br>0 &le; <var>C</var> &lt; <var>W</var></div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Example</div>\n      <div class=\"statement-inout\">\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-in\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-in\">3 3\n1 2 3\n4 5 6\n7 8 9\n1 1</pre>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-out\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-out\">20</pre>\n         </div>\n      </div>\n   </div>\n</div>"
